invariant: INV-25
file: webpki_cert.c
catches: webpki_cert_test
reason: the reader a leaf pinned with no anchor goes through skips the
  extensions and stops there, so a TBSCertificate with a byte after its
  extensions reads as the key beside it: two encodings name one leaf.
  test/webpki_cert_key_mutants.h's byte-after-the-extensions row objects.

--- old
    if (!x509_skip(&t, TAG_EXTENSIONS) || t.err || rb_left(&t) != 0) {
--- new
    if (!x509_skip(&t, TAG_EXTENSIONS) || t.err) {
